  "title": "Charles Darwin",
  "summary": "Darwin was born in 1809 and joined HMS Beagle in December 1831 for a five-year voyage. In September 1842 he moved with his family to Down House at Downe, where he developed his theory of natural selection and wrote On the Origin of Species (1859). He died in 1882.",
